#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD9747 expect=noViolation domain=PP
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when PPCAT and the related PC record's PCRFTDTC are populated, PPRFTDTC equals PC.PCRFTDTC, and PPCAT does not equal PC.PCTEST.
#note "Pins the authority reading (the RELREC-related PC record only). One RELREC group relates the PP record to a PC record that AGREES (same reference timepoint, PCTEST equals PPCAT) and to an LB record at the SAME reference timepoint whose LBTEST differs from PPCAT. The engine pairs PP with both; on the PP-LB pairing RELREC.PCRFTDTC is absent, reads empty, and the not-empty guard keeps the row silent. Sensitivity arm: rewriting RELREC.PCRFTDTC / RELREC.PCTEST to RELREC.**RFTDTC / RELREC.**TEST (upstream Wildcard alias meaning) makes the PP-LB pairing fire exactly once (PLAN-match-datasets-wildcard)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset PP label="Pharmacokinetics Parameters"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col PPSEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col PPCAT type=Char label="Parameter Category"
col PPRFTDTC type=Char label="Date/Time of Reference Point"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | PP | 01-701-1015 | 1 | DRUG_X | 2014-01-15
---

dataset PC label="Pharmacokinetics Concentrations"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col PCSEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col PCTEST type=Char label="Pharmacokinetic Test Name"
col PCRFTDTC type=Char label="Date/Time of Reference Point"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | PC | 01-701-1015 | 1 | DRUG_X | 2014-01-15
---

dataset LB label="Laboratory Test Results"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col LBSEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col LBTEST type=Char label="Lab Test or Examination Name"
col LBRFTDTC type=Char label="Date/Time of Reference Point"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | LB | 01-701-1015 | 1 | GLUCOSE | 2014-01-15
---

dataset RELREC label="Related Records"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col RDOMAIN type=Char label="Related Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col IDVAR type=Char label="Identifying Variable"
col IDVARVAL type=Char label="Identifying Variable Value"
col RELID type=Char label="Relationship Identifier"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | PP | 01-701-1015 | PPSEQ | 1 | R1
CDISCPILOT01 | PC | 01-701-1015 | PCSEQ | 1 | R1
CDISCPILOT01 | LB | 01-701-1015 | LBSEQ | 1 | R1
---
